{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10609004","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10609004","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1060900401:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">欢歌宴会</style>是秘银商会为群星盛典特意举办的！他们还邀请了达米安，用他新研发的木翼机来为大家庆祝！","source_cn":"<style=highlight>欢歌宴会</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5061C46FDCA5A2B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1060900402:0":{"text":"在欢歌宴会上，你可以通过做各种各样的<style=\"highlight\">社交动作</style>积累活跃度，获得宴会纪念品——星光礼券。","source_cn":"在欢歌宴会上，你可以通过做各种各样的<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD032BB387FF9A660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1060900404:0":{"text":"宴会上来找我可以使用木翼机道具进行<style=\"highlight\">木翼机试航</style>啦！放飞木翼机不仅可以获得<style=\"highlight\">星源水晶</style>，在场的宴会参与者也有机会收到<style=\"highlight\">木翼机礼馈</style>，其中包含钻石奖励哦！","source_cn":"宴会上来找我可以使用木翼机道具进行<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1DCAC10FDF6C24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芝妮":{"text":"芝妮","source":"芝妮","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}